.nh
.TH "RUDDER-CLI" "1" "Jan 1970" "rudder-cli" "Rudder CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
rudder-cli-typer-options - Show available options for a platform


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrudder-cli typer options [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the supported generator options, descriptions, and defaults for a target platform. Pass --platform with kotlin, swift, or typescript.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for options

.PP
\fB--platform\fP=""
	Platform to show options for (kotlin, swift, typescript)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP="~/.rudder/config.json"
	config file (default is '~/.rudder/config.json')


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  rudder-cli typer options --platform kotlin
  rudder-cli typer options --platform typescript
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBrudder-cli-typer(1)\fP
